# Laptop use to the phone and the phone's sessions and nights to ActivityWatch, when the phone is on adb (Phase 4). With Wi-Fi
# sync paired (Phase 5, nocturne-serve.service) the phone does this itself and this timer is only for a phone on USB.
[Unit]
Description=Nocturne laptop and phone sync
After=aw-server.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 %h/26_class/Nocturne/tools/activitywatch/nocturne_aw.py sync --if-connected --wifi
